Package: gxde-qt6integration
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libdtk2widget6, dde-qt6integration
Description: Qt6 style plugin for GXDE applications built on DTK 2.x
 Provides libdstyleplugin-gxde-qt6.so, a Qt6 QStyle plugin that gives
 DTK 2.x Qt6 applications a Deepin-style appearance (light, dark,
 semi-light, semi-dark variants).
 .
 Style keys: dlight2 / ddark2 / dsemilight2 / dsemidark2.
 .
 Coexists with:
   - gxde-qt5integration (Qt5 dstyleplugin-gxde, claims dlight/ddark/...)
   - dde-qt6integration  (DTK 6.x chameleon, claims chameleon)
 Installs to the standard Qt6 styles plugin dir alongside chameleon;
 the keys never overlap so Qt's QStyleFactory routes correctly.
